    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d692">

                <pb facs="0692" n="622" sameAs="frus:frus1934v04/pg622"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.51/867: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-02T15:00:00-05:00">February 2, 1934—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>15. Your 24, February 1, 6 p.m. Council eager arrange satisfactory publicity
                    regarding debt arrangement. Will you therefore try to get <pb facs="0693"
                        n="623" xml:id="pg623"/> in advance advice as to date when Brazilian
                    Government is going to publish official plan so that Council may give out
                    suitable announcement on the same day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
